                    "about_studio_story": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>So I approached it the way an architect approaches anything that is not working. Back to basics first. Old-school, proper foundations. Then one masterclass after another, from LA to Mexico, florist after florist, until I understood not just how to arrange flowers but why some things work and others simply do not.</p><p>What I did not expect was what flowers gave back to me. They give me much more than I can ever give to my clients. Flowers gave my mind somewhere to go again. A place to express myself. Confidence I had not felt in years. They did not just become my work. They became where I am most myself.</p>",
                        "text_color": "",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "custom",
