            "about_market": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Every Wednesday I go to the downtown flower market. I lay everything out on the table and start pairing colours. I take my time. I touch the stems, check the freshness, test combinations. I know most of the vendors by name: many from Mexico, some from South America, some from as far as Poland. The picking is where the arrangement begins, long before I touch a single stem at home.</p>",
