            "about_colour": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Colour leads everything. Always. Sometimes I feel purple. Sometimes warm and golden. Sometimes something sharp and unexpected. The colour finds me first, and the arrangement follows from there. That is the only way I know how to work.</p><p>When I work with flowers my head travels somewhere else. My architecture training, my eye for interiors, my instinct for colour. It all meets there. Every arrangement reflects that particular week. My mood, my energy, whatever that Friday asked for.</p><p>I do not recreate arrangements, even my own. Every piece belongs to the moment it was made in—the flowers at the market that morning, the light in the studio, what the week brought. What stays consistent is the style and the eye behind it. You will always get something that is unmistakably mine.</p>",
